# WE framework

- NEVER edit `gamemodes/default/**` for features. Add AS under `src/we/` (`core/`, `utils/`, `player/`, `features/`); build injects.
- Custom GTs: `gamemodes/custom/progs/gametypes/` (gitignored). Overlay wins on build.
- Injector: `scripts/inject/` (+ thin `scripts/inject.py`). Default files get `we_` filename prefix (no stock pk3 collision); custom keeps original names. Renames engine `GT_*` → `GT_*__orig`; wrappers in `gen/wrappers.as`. New engine hook ⇒ update `ENGINE_HOOKS`/`HOOK_SIGS` in `scripts/inject/constants.py`.
- Repo path contains `warfork-extended`; never test `"warfork-extended" in path.parts` — use `relative_to(progs/gametypes/warfork-extended)`.
- Runtime data: `basewf/warfork-extended/*.txt` (`banlist.txt`, `users/<steamid>.txt`, `locks.txt`). Soft locks only on writes (`WE_WriteFileLocked`); reads never lock. Format `name=unix@ip:port`, 1s TTL.
- Cvars: `we_enabled`, `we_debug`, `we_feature_<name>` — example only in `configs/warfork-extended.cfg.example`; paste into `server.cfg` (no auto-write). `src/we/player/` is always on when `we_enabled` is 1 (no `we_feature_users`).
- Features: register with `WE_Hooks_Add*` / `WE_Cmds_Add` (funcdef registries in `core/hook_types.as`). Cmds default prefix `we_`. Identity = steam_id. Custom GTs: `WE_GetPlayerData`/`WE_SetPlayerData` → keys forced to `cust_*` (see `development.md`).
- Build: `make`/`make dev`/`make prod`. Version: `VERSION` → GH release workflow.
- Ref quarry (not shipped): `idea/progs/gametypes/agungame/`.
